  "description": "Rengvo is the Abstract play structure with built-in shade. Sail shades stretch over its platforms, which helps on hot afternoons in much of India. Underneath, children climb a ladder, cross a rope net bridge and come down by orange spiral slides. It takes 35 to 40 children, has a product area of 31' x 19'9\" and needs a safe play area of 37' x 25'9\". That makes it one of the larger pieces in the series, suited to parks and big school grounds. Rengvo lists leadership, self-directed play, concentration and motor skills among its skills. Its colours are multi-colour. The galvanised pipes, moulded parts, laminates and rope carry a 3-year warranty. Ask us for a quote.",
